<description>&lt;p&gt;Mexican authorities have arrested an alleged Jalisco cartel leader in Zapopan and captured a cartel cell with DEA intelligence, while a mayor who had been abducted was recovered alive after hours. Police helicopters opened fire on a cartel chase near the U.S. border, killing a 7-year-old American girl. Villagers who were kidnapped for weeks reported that cartels now dominate rural communities, extending control beyond urban areas. The conflict recorded 37 battle-related deaths in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxOQkZDWkU2MFBSQ09IcWp0bmY3akRNSzROVEREQnVRTmdBblV5alFxZEVfZ0dXSkNnNmtCWXJTS1ZDVzlPSlRyRzJZTWgyX0tYaFAzblpUcUdDM3dSQjdNdkxGRGhrekc3bEtXQjJTTWpndFpJaXlZNUhlUzE3VU5GSnFHQjUwT215ei12Z1prd3UwTVItdzhaNTkyS0hpRVRzWGxmYWRGTkhFTFo4NmU2bG5UVmx5NldSeV9QUXlRVWxlQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxOYXhEUmc1OTQzZmZqSU1adTk3UzFDSXBwLXQ0LVJTUkthMlpBQi0yNE40V1hLR0JuNG4wanpOZlIzTlBPMjZlN3lYTkVBbzRyQmVEOVJkcWtvWElJRHJfNE1vanRDcVFnUFlZcjJha0huX2J5clZmZU9HNTdvT2k3VmdWcmZyNHF2MUpSNloyeF9tdUxoOTlqb1pjbW1TSmdVRk1Kbnk5dlBpak96dF9WUGdtcHUtNlpTUnc?oc=5&quot;&gt;WSJ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiyAFBVV95cUxPX1VmS1NXVnB6cnlMRmRRM1dubDY3eGM0Q2stbWlSSVN4dUl0cGNMblQ0ZlU0cVVVUUluSGRubkcyYlFkTTV1TUx3VURtYjZhV2pKa1NXdlUxYTNqa3c1amJ4V1BwLUgzNE84cms0WmtId1RwNVVCX1JQS3U1d2J0XzlOU0hmS01lNVNXZ1NhV1ZmMF9sVHdGSVVxVTd4TmM4RTREMzcxYW85WVZIcVhkVnpSMENZOEhCbW44TW55Uk9kbktBd0xVaA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxQZ3AwQmY3d2NENVh1elhIdWFmNXBnb1hOY3MzOFQ0WV